Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_1dfcd353-f955-3406-a6cf-b88cdec188b7.xml</text>
